    // kept as the LORD’s portion); and the New Testament as the long rescue that
    // reverses Babel at Pentecost to regather the disinherited nations through
    // Christ. FRAMING (binding): Heiser is a GUIDE to the ancient context, not the
    // authority -- the WORD is (DR-0098); the lesson teaches Scripture from its own
    // usage (Genesis 6 "sons of God" through Job 1:6 / 38:7 -- the house’s own
