    // FOLLOWS the house’s already-written biblical views (THE-ROOT / THE-ROOT-
    // POSITIONS: divine council + Genesis 6 = HIGH confidence; Deut 32:8 + the
    // Enoch mechanism = named, canon-pending), so it ships like any content and
    // is reviewed LIVE on production (DR-0104), not held (Darrell 2026-07-15: "the
