  // platform: "all of this is a war of the mind according to the King of Kings,"
  // the enemy's origin (created, flourished, undermined, cast out), and the
  // believer equipped with the Word whom he "may" not devour. Companion to the
  // Layer-3 foundation KINGDOM-SYSTEMS-AND-THE-WAR-OF-THE-MIND.md + DR-0188. Every
  // quoted verse is KJV, fetched VERBATIM from the sovereign in-app Bible
