    "bigIdea": "A leader's real value is not out-expertising the experts but connecting them — surfacing the quiet risk, asking the missing question, and joining the members Yahweh has gifted. The Word calls this the body: many members, different gifts, set together by God so none can say to another, I have no need of thee.",
    "inApp": "Name one project, ministry, or family decision you are carrying alone right now. List the three people whose gift you have NOT yet joined in, and one quiet risk or missing question you have been ignoring — then take the connecting step this week instead of trying to be the expert yourself.",
