  // L60 — a health-teaching video forwarded by Darrell as a Lesson, 2026-07-27:
  // Dr. Samantha Jean and Dr. Gerdie Jean-Smith on thyroid health and hair loss
  // in menopause. Harvested the established mixed-source way (L36/L46/L53):
