        'Land the two small words FIRST: "even as" — prosperity is paced to the soul, not a flood.',
        'Draw the three parts plainly (spirit / soul / body) and where each stands: spirit reborn (John 3:6), soul being renewed (Romans 12:2), and the gap between them (Galatians 5:17).',
