        'What does "keep your lamp lit" concretely mean for you this season — and what has let yours run low (Matthew 25:1-13)?',
        'When someone uses Matthew 24:36 to challenge Jesus\' deity, how would you answer them now — in one gracious minute, from the text (Colossians 2:9; John 21:17)?',
