        'Handle the testimony without narrating it. Say what happened at the level of NAMING (occult, the industry, addiction, homelessness, a coerced abortion clinic) and immediately take each to the text. Retelling details for effect re-wounds survivors in the room and feeds appetite — that restraint is part of the teaching, and worth saying out loud.',
