  // L86 — Darrell's lesson input, 2026-08-24: the Gospel of Luke survey he is
  // teaching through (framework: Tommy C. Higle, "Journey of a Lifetime: A
  // 52-Lesson Study through the Entire Bible", 1992 — cited as the study
