        'Jesus said, "The Son can do nothing of himself, but what he seeth the Father do" (John 5:19). What would it change this week to make His WILL — not your feelings — the deciding factor, and to ask for the Mind of Christ (1 Corinthians 2:16) to want what He wants?',
