        'But do not chase the crowd\'s hype: buy-the-hype-sell-the-news is the fickle rally the Word says never to build on (Proverbs 23:4-5; 1 Timothy 6:17; Proverbs 27:1). Build on Yahweh (Psalms 127:1; Proverbs 16:3).',
