        'WORD FIRST / the bright line: "be ye doers of the word, and not hearers only, deceiving your own selves" (James 1:22). Spoken into the app by the Governor 2026-08-28 - gain competence by DOING, not just hearing/reading; captured same session, every verse verbatim KJV.',
