        'The delegated/reserved line and the summit: He gives power to create WEALTH (Deuteronomy 8:18) but not LIGHT/KNOWLEDGE - He IS them (John 8:12; Colossians 2:3); man is crowned above creatures (Psalms 8:5-6) yet proved through the test of time (Deuteronomy 8:2; James 1:12), and the highest attainment is to KNOW HIM (Jeremiah 9:23-24; John 17:3). Apply daily (Joshua 1:8); seek/do/teach (Ezra 7:10).',
