        'WORD FIRST / captured from Darrell\'s spoken testimony 2026-08-29 (a spoken teaching is build input - DR-0089): Yahweh sets life and death before us, we choose life (Deuteronomy 30:19), and Jesus did it in ACTION, not theory. Every verse verbatim KJV; his 3rd/4th-dimensional frame is his testimony\'s language laid alongside the Word.',
