      'Makes excellence evangelism - souls respect excellence, and His ambassadors win them by it (Proverbs 11:30; Daniel 6:3; Colossians 3:23; Matthew 5:16; 2 Corinthians 5:20). Pairs with the Excellence Standard (representatives of the King).',
      'Anchors the necessary skill in comprehensive study of His Word - the way, truth, life (John 14:6), rightly divided (2 Timothy 2:15), searched daily (Acts 17:11), furnishing every good work (2 Timothy 3:16-17) - with the destination already written (Isaiah 46:10; Revelation 22:12; Psalm 1:6). Pairs with L102, L99, the Test.',
