      'Directly serves the platform\'s purpose - a Word-first, deterministic self-examination that removes self-deception and debate (DR-0098): the Scriptures teach Yahweh\'s perspective so the reader sees his real ways, not what he projects. Pairs with L102 (integrity), L103 (two paths), and the Godhead Study.',
