        'Answer out loud, without looking anything up: the teacher’s name, the medication, the closest friends, the thing your spouse is dreading this week. "dwell with them according to knowledge" (1 Peter 3:7) is attention that accumulated. Which blank did you find, and how will you close it?',
        'The clip asks: are you making her life easier? Philippians 2:4 asks the same thing - "Look not every man on his own things, but every man also on the things of others." When did you last look at your spouse’s week rather than your own tally, and what did you see, or what would you see if you did it tonight?',
