        'Genesis 2:18 says the first problem was ALONE, and Ecclesiastes 4:9-12 says what a second cord is for - lifted when you fall, warm instead of cold, held when something prevails. Ask the widowed in the room what was actually lost. Then answer the lesson’s question about yourself: what makes having you better?',
