            'The predicted pattern - the sown word is struck at immediately (Mark 4:15,17), and the Lord’s own sequence was affirmation then wilderness: "This is my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased." (Matthew 3:17), then "Then was Jesus led up of the Spirit into the wilderness to be tempted of the devil." (Matthew 4:1). The answer is in a fixed order: "Submit yourselves therefore to God. Resist the devil, and he will flee from you." (James 4:7)',
