        'For the one who was not sent for (1 Samuel 16:11): what has it cost you to keep that story in the version you tell yourself? Read 1 Samuel 16:7 and Psalm 27:10 out loud, then say what changes in the telling.',
        'Where has an explanation for your life quietly become a sentence? Name it, then read Ezekiel 18:20 and 2 Corinthians 5:17 against it - and be specific about what forgetting those things which are behind would actually require of you this month.',
        'Whose ledger are you still running - a brother, a sister, a parent? Read Galatians 6:4 and Luke 15:31 together. What would closing that account cost you, and what has keeping it open already cost?',
