        'The claim that a woman follows by nature is not in Scripture, but many of us absorbed it somewhere. Where did you first hear it, and what happens to it when you read Deborah (Judges 4:4-5), Huldah (2 Kings 22:14-15), Abigail (1 Samuel 25:33), Priscilla (Acts 18:26) and Proverbs 31:16,24,26?',
        'For anyone single and holding a list: is there an item on it that is really asking for someone with fewer options rather than better character (Malachi 2:14-16)? And separately - what would it cost you to be measured by Ephesians 5:25 the way you have been measuring others?',
        'Yahweh judges by fruit observed over seasons (Matthew 7:16,20), which is slow, and a category is fast. Where in your life have you taken the fast method on a real person - and what would it take this month to go and find their actual fruit instead?',
